### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### FOLDERS WORKFLOW - Archiving Sub-System
### Base Route: api/ArchiveSystem/Folders
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7010
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..Q2jA5PJdQpjOZ9F0wnU_2GCorgyE4UQlEIGWMeofAmQ

@folderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. GET ALL FOLDERS
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ArchiveSystem/Folders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. GET FOLDER BY ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ArchiveSystem/Folders/{{folderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. CREATE FOLDER
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ArchiveSystem/Folders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Folder Name",
  "parentId": null,
  "departmentId": null
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. UPDATE FOLDER
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/ArchiveSystem/Folders/{{folderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Folder Name"
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 5. MOVE FOLDER (NEW)
### Move a folder to a different parent folder
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/ArchiveSystem/Folders/MoveFolder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "folderId": "{{folderId}}",
  "destnationFolderId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 6. DELETE FOLDER
### Requires DepartmentArchiveLeader authorization
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/ArchiveSystem/Folders/{{folderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
